{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56399","headline":"寄弟 · 冯友仁","name":"寄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"义心既重利心轻，分异何乖手足情。\n糗饭自饴虞舜乐，采薇独守伯夷清。\n析居不忍从亲令，退逊甘当矫世名。\n贤弟晨昏勤定省，莫因流落念而兄。\n（《坚瓠己集》卷四。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯友仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}